<title>CROATIA: Croatia Pliva sees 97 net exceeding 96 net.</title>
<headline>Croatia Pliva sees 97 net exceeding 96 net.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Croatia's flagship drugs firm Pliva said on Friday it saw 1997 net profit rising further from the 456 million kuna posted in 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;We hope to ensure a larger net profit for our shareholders than last year,&quot; president Zeljko Covic told a news conference.</p>
</text>
